{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t一名39歲內地男旅客今日從馬來西亞檳城飛抵本港，被發現隨身行李帶有2.2公斤懷疑可卡因，市值約130萬元。男子被海關拘捕，他已被控一項販運危險藥物罪，案件明日在西九龍裁判法院提堂。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n海關表示，會加強打擊販運毒品活動，並呼籲市民提高警覺，切勿貪圖金錢利益而參與販毒活動。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：李俊傑\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:30.774179+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T14:40:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T05:58:33.975492+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:14:12.144244+00:00","content_hash":"3b97e20cf4a29430eeeeb487938af6fb6a455286f7c6e4d32ba71423cf61e9cd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}